#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills {#qiskit-ai-skills}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) has a "
"set of skills that you can use with AI assistants, such as Bob, Claude, or "
"ChatGPT. An AI skill is a reusable set of instructions that teaches the "
"assistant how to complete a specific task.  Skills can help save time and "
"ensure that repeatable tasks are done consistently and correctly.  \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first available skill is `migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime`, for migrating "
"`qiskit-ibm-runtime` code.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use a Qiskit AI skill, follow the instructions for your AI assistant.  In"
" general, you just need to give the skill to the assistant, then tell it "
"where to apply the skill.\n"
msgstr ""
